<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia Sept reserves rise to 1.76 bln dinars.</title>
<headline>Tunisia Sept reserves rise to 1.76 bln dinars.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's total foreign exchange reserves rose to 1.760 billion dinars at September 30 from 1.552 billion at August 31, Central Bank figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>    TUNISIA RESERVES    Sept 96	Aug 96     Dec 95</p>
<p>    Gold and Foreign	1,732	 1,524	1,530</p>
<p>    SDRs			   28	    28	   12</p>
<p>Note - Figures in millions of dinars and subject to rounding. $1=0.97 dinar.</p>
</text>
